   "source": [
    "# Paper Metrics — Validation & Visualization\n",
    "\n",
    "Literature-style face-validity figures for the paper metrics, all rendered inline:\n",
    "1. **Disruption frequency spectrum** (raw CD distribution, symlog).\n",
    "2. **Team size → disruption percentile & impact** (Wu et al. 2019 Fig 2a style: small teams disrupt, large teams get cited).\n",
    "3. **Atypicality 2×2 hit probability** (Uzzi et al. 2013: median conventionality × tail novelty → hit-paper rate).\n",
    "4. **Atypicality CDF** (distribution of median & 10th-pct Z).\n",
    "5. **Sleeping Beauty** validation (B / T distributions, B vs eventual citations, top sleeping beauties).\n",
    "\n",
    "Inputs: `notebook/paper/output/{paper_disruption, paper_citation, paper_metadata, paper_sb, paper_hit_probability, paper_z_score}.parquet`.\n",
    "Atypicality figures need `paper_z_score.parquet` (decade 1990–2000); they are skipped gracefully if it is absent."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 1,
   "id": "d9251b56",
   "metadata": {
    "execution": {
     "iopub.execute_input": "2026-08-31T22:52:43.183196Z",
