   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "e437696c",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 6. Cumulative citation trajectory — convexity for HIT top-1% papers (FoS level-0)\n",
    "\n",
    "Restricted to **hit top-1% papers** (`pctl_c5 >= 0.99`, top 1% by 5-yr citations within FoS × year), using\n",
    "**all** such papers (no sampling). Per-paper **cumulative** paper→paper (`p2p`) curves are min–max scaled;\n",
    "the **convexity index** = 1 − mean(normalised citation age) (`<0.5` convex = late burst; `>0.5` concave).\n",
    "Computed out-of-core with DuckDB over the 452M-row trend. Field breakdown = **FoS level-0**."
   ]
  },
